From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wig Cheng <wigcheng@ieiworld.com>
Date: Sun, 18 May 2026 17:31:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] transpose optimizer: include <cstdint> for uint8_t

GCC 15 in ubuntu 26.04 no longer transitively includes <cstdint>
through <vector> / <string>. optimizer_api.h uses uint8_t but does
not include the proper header, causing:

    error: 'uint8_t' was not declared in this scope

Add the missing include explicitly.

Signed-off-by: Wig Cheng <wigcheng@ieiworld.com>
---
 onnxruntime/core/optimizer/transpose_optimization/optimizer_api.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/onnxruntime/core/optimizer/transpose_optimization/optimizer_api.h b/onnxruntime/core/optimizer/transpose_optimization/optimizer_api.h
--- a/onnxruntime/core/optimizer/transpose_optimization/optimizer_api.h
+++ b/onnxruntime/core/optimizer/transpose_optimization/optimizer_api.h
@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@
 #include <unordered_map>
 #include <unordered_set>
 #include <vector>
+#include <cstdint>

 namespace onnx_transpose_optimization {

--
2.45.0
